{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03154","headline":"尝与大理丞袁公太府丞田公偶诣一所林沼尤胜因并坐其次相得甚欢遂赋诗焉以咏其事 · 张九龄","name":"尝与大理丞袁公太府丞田公偶诣一所林沼尤胜因并坐其次相得甚欢遂赋诗焉以咏其事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"方驾与吾友，同怀不异寻。\n偶逢池竹处，便会江湖心。\n夏近林方密，春余水更深。\n清华两辉暎，闲步亦窥临。\n苹藻复佳色，凫鷖亦好音。\n韶芳媚洲渚，蕙气袭衣襟。\n萧散皆爲乐，裴回从所钦。\n谓予成夙志，岁晚共抽簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03154.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03154","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}